      "sha256": "83a21464017c7a241bf890f2ac6b54e5069b2d4175ce9c93a2a3a175889f4dcd",
      "source": "ssot/engos-debug-diagnose-failure.md",
      "text": "Do not infer an architecture defect from a fixed number of failed fixes, or enter a guess-fix loop."
