      "source": "ssot/engos-debug-diagnose-failure.md",
      "text": "- Do not interpret a successful rerun as causal proof, silently weaken an oracle, skip a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "d76de20cdcaee725603f6c4e13078a2a88074fe01d9b895dc8d173472aa4e1a4",
      "source": "ssot/engos-debug-diagnose-failure.md",
      "text": "- Preserve active processes, user data and unrelated work. Stop only your own bounded"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "632b0eeb7d3427ed5c5d271f3de69ff4f3314705c378c2c53faf1aa396423f32",
      "source": "ssot/engos-debug-diagnose-failure.md",
